            "Confidentiality": "no",
            "Integrity": "no",
            "Availability": "no",
            "Undermined Expected Behavior": "no"
          },
          "Answer Lines": [],
          "Answer Reason": "The logic block assigns other sysinfo words at lines 102-150 and does not modify the writable word at sysinfo(0); only integrity is in scope."
        },
        {
          "Point": "access_buffer",
          "Reached By": "backward from bus_rsp_o through the arrow access_buffer ==> bus_rsp_o [buf_ack, buf_adr]",
