              "Direction": "b"
            }
          ],
          "Functionality": "Supplies the replacement word loaded into sysinfo by the bus-write path.",
          "Justification": "It explicitly flows into the primary at line 95 and can therefore alter the stored value; as a bus-request field it cannot be primary.",
          "Asset Lines": [
            95
          ]
        },
        {
